{"availability":"available","full":"Fripix/Frirss","name":"Frirss","description":"A modern, self-hosted, customizable web frontend for FreshRSS.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":82,"forks":7,"created":"2026-05-20T08:55:21Z","updated":"2026-10-15T21:24:01Z","license":"MIT","branch":"dev","homepage":null,"topics":["docker","feed-reader","freshrss","pwa","react","rss","rss-reader","self-hosted","typescript"],"demo":"https://frirss.fripix.ch/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:45:58.644Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T21:45:58.644Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T21:45:58.644Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:22:10.997Z","stars":79,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:13:00.310Z","stars":81,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:04:29.500Z","stars":81,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-13T07:34:45.277Z","stars":82,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-15T21:45:58.644Z","stars":82,"forks":7}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A self-hosted, customizable web frontend for FreshRSS.","FreshRSS has an excellent engine: solid, self-hosted, great at fetching and storing feeds. Its built-in interface just wasn't for me, and none of the alternatives fit what I wanted — so I built my own.","FriRSS sits on top of FreshRSS through its Google Reader API and replaces only the interface."],"features":["Three panes on desktop, and an installable PWA on mobile with swipe navigation, swipe actions and pull-to-refresh.","Full-text extraction (Readability) when a feed only ships a summary — cached, so re-reads are instant. A global default (Preferences → General → Full article by default, off out of the box) opens every article in full;…","Oldest first, if you prefer — a global order in Preferences → General, overridable per feed from its menu. FreshRSS serves the pages in that order, so it holds across infinite scroll, and mark everything above / below…","FreshRSS's per-feed visibility is honoured — a feed set to show in its category only (or in its own view only) stays out of All feeds and Unread, out of their counts, and out of Mark all as read from there, while it…","Offline reading. Articles stay readable without a connection, images included. Favorites and read-later are kept automatically; a one-tap Prepare offline sweep covers the last 30 days across every feed."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Fripix/Frirss/blob/dev/README.md","fingerprint":"f856c67cf197f1b82180e799d1b62067d840b3ecb53f4bafb2f5e6475526836a","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T21:45:58.749Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:45:58.749Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A self-hosted, customizable web frontend for FreshRSS.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Fripix/Frirss/blob/dev/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Then open and create the first account — it becomes the administrator.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Fripix/Frirss/blob/dev/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Most self-hosted instances are — on a Docker network, anything your router alone can reach.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Fripix/Frirss/blob/dev/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"f856c67cf197f1b82180e799d1b62067d840b3ecb53f4bafb2f5e6475526836a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Fripix/Frirss/blob/dev/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T21:45:58.751Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T21:24:01Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Fripix/Frirss/blob/dev/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T21:45:58.754Z","hash":"f856c67cf197f1b82180e799d1b62067d840b3ecb53f4bafb2f5e6475526836a","originalBytes":20994,"storedBytes":20994,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["freshrss","article","frirss","feed","read","nbsp","preferences","every","one","data","feeds","proxy","server","unread","cache","default","instance","only","per","url","api","app","articles","file","mark","open","opens","page","rather","same","what","back","docker","first